# QA Automation Conventions

- Follow the PrismStructure layout: `pages/`, `fixtures/`, `tests/ui/`, `tests/api/`, `utils/`, `test-data/`
- Limit to **5–8 test cases per tier** (manual, UI, API) with `@smoke` and `@regression` tags
- Map every test to an acceptance criterion (AC1, AC2) in comments or CSV traceability
- Do not expand scope beyond assessment core flows without explicit request
- Prefer iterative commits — avoid single large commits
- Record meaningful AI prompts in `ai-prompts/` after each phase
- Do not invent SUT behavior; verify against live UI and OpenAPI documentation
- Known UI behavior: invoice may require **confirm pressed twice** — document in tests when implemented
